-attachments/assets/a6324102-49be-41eb-83b3-8aebd9c3485d\" alt=\"a6324102-49be-41eb-83b3-8aebd9c3485d\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Some new .357 Magnum ammo:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>.357 Magnum FMJ +P+ -&gt; Peacekeeper LL2</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">.300 Blackout</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExeDQyMnZ1ZHNxcHp0Zm05djhyMmhuN21tMnU5cjAxNXJiYzJ2enJ4MSZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/QMBW8drCAkpH8hS7ny/giphy.gif\" alt=\"giphy.gif\" /></p>\n<p>Some new .300 Blackout Ammo:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>.300 Blackout TAC-TX -&gt; Peacekeeper LL2</li>\n<li>.300 Blackout TCX -&gt; Peacekeeper LL3</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">.338 Lapua Magnum</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec121722-df04-4e75-a729-a93d7dbf4937\" alt=\"ec121722-df04-4e75-a729-a93d7dbf4937\" /></p>\n<p>Some new .338 Lapua Magnum Ammo:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>.338 Lapua Magnum SP -&gt; Prapor LL3</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">7.62x51mm</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExNjI4a2hqNG1oMHdjdnNscWc5eW80aWU1a2ppbnVjMXpwZG5rZmh0NyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/ykIU1LSA5YFDCzH0HO/giphy.gif\" alt=\"giphy.gif\" /></p>\n<p>Some new 7.62x51mm Ammo:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>7.62x51mm M118LR Match -&gt; Peacekeeper LL3</li>\n<li>7.62x51mm M80A1 -&gt; Peacekeeper LL3</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">5.56x45mm</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be3a3de7-5c0f-4911-9335-a05d1462fa9b\" alt=\"be3a3de7