-79ae-46f2-9f33-735e042eabc4\" alt=\"4e1d4516-79ae-46f2-9f33-735e042eabc4\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Oil Filter Suppressor for PM(T) -&gt; Mechanic LL1</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-10\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract vinihns-lotsofammo.zip into your SPT game folder. (Yes, it’s SAIN, but the same concept applies to all of my mods)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-11\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Config</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>config/config.json</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-12\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">{ “enableLogs”: false // Enable or disab</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>If you have any ideas (other cartridges, new models) feel free to leave a comment or hit me up on discord: bagreassalariado.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-13\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>5.56x45mm M855 Ammo Can (420 pcs) by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/creationwasteland\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">creationwasteland</a></p>\n<p>.357 Magnum FMJ +P+ by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/deadcomrade\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">deadcomrade</a></p>\n<p>9x19mm Hornady Critical Defense FTx® by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bahngo.artstation.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">noah glenn</a></p>\n<p>9x19mm Federal HST by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bahngo.artstation.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">noah glenn</a></p>\n<p>9x19mm Tula Steel case by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://bahngo.artstation.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">noah glenn</a></p>\n<p>9x19mm Soft Point